        "approval_date": "4th July 2025",
        "version": null,
        "text": "Section 5 - Policy Statement\n(3)\nThis procedure forms part of the\nRecruitment Policy\nsuite which governs its application."
    },
    {
        "chunk_id": "58-6",
        "document_id": "58",
        "policy_title": "Recruitment Procedure -  Head of Department",
        "heading_level": "h3",
        "section": "Section 6 - Procedures",
        "subsection": null,
        "topic": "Internal Appointments",
        "subtopic": null,
        "paragraph_start": 4,
        "paragraph_end": 4,
        "source_url": "https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/document/view.php?id=58",
        "status_details_url": "https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/document/status-and-details.php?id=58",
        "status": "Current",
        "effective_date": "4th July 2025",
        "review_date": "4th July 2028",
        "approval_authority": "Vice-Chancellor",
        "approval_date": "4th July 2025",
        "version": null,
        "text": "Internal Appointments\n(4)\nGenerally, the Head of Department position is open only to internal applicants."
    },
    {
        "chunk_id": "58-7",
        "document_id": "58",
        "policy_title": "Recruitment Procedure -  Head of Department",
        "heading_level": "h3",
        "section": "Section 6 - Procedures",
        "subsection": null,
        "topic": "Responsibility",
        "subtopic": null,
        "paragraph_start": 5,
        "paragraph_end": 5,
        "source_url": "https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/document/view.php?id=58",
        "status_details_url": "https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/document/status-and-details.php?id=58",
        "status": "Current",
        "effective_date": "4th July 2025",
        "review_date": "4th July 2028",
        "approval_authority": "Vice-Chancellor",
        "approval_date": "4th July 2025",
        "version": null,
        "text": "Responsibility\n(5)\nThe Dean is responsible for the appointment process of Heads of Departments within their school. The Dean may call for expressions of interest or offer a subsequent contract to the incumbent of the Head of Department position.  The Provost has final authority to approve the appointment of the Head of Department position."
    },
    {
        "chunk_id": "58-8",
        "document_id": "58",
        "policy_title": "Recruitment Procedure -  Head of Department",
        "heading_level": "h3",
        "section": "Section 6 - Procedures",
        "subsection": null,
        "topic": "Eligibility",
        "subtopic": null,
        "paragraph_start": 6,
        "paragraph_end": 7,
        "source_url": "https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/document/view.php?id=58",
        "status_details_url": "https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/document/status-and-details.php?id=58",
        "status": "Current",
        "effective_date": "4th July 2025",
        "review_date": "4th July 2028",
        "approval_authority": "Vice-Chancellor",
        "approval_date": "4th July 2025",
        "version": null,
        "text": "Eligibility\n(6)\nStaff members at Level C or above may be eligible to express an interest in the position of Head of Department.\n(7)\nHowever, on recommendation of the Dean, the Provost may determine that staff members at Level B are eligible to express an interest."
    },
    {
        "chunk_id": "58-9",
        "document_id": "58",
        "policy_title": "Recruitment Procedure -  Head of Department",
        "heading_level": "h3",
        "section": "Section 6 - Procedures",
        "subsection": null,
        "topic": "Terms of Appointment",
        "subtopic": null,
        "paragraph_start": 8,
        "paragraph_end": 8,
        "source_url": "https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/document/view.php?id=58",
        "status_details_url": "https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/document/status-and-details.php?id=58",
        "status": "Current",
        "effective_date": "4th July 2025",
        "review_date": "4th July 2028",
        "approval_authority": "Vice-Chancellor",
        "approval_date": "4th July 2025",
        "version": null,
        "text": "Terms of Appointment\n(8)\nThe Head of Department appointment will combine a substantive academic position with a fixed-term secondment to Head of Department position (up to a maximum of three (3) years)."
    },
    {
        "chunk_id": "58-10",
        "document_id": "58",
        "policy_title": "Recruitment Procedure -  Head of Department",
        "heading_level": "h3",
        "section": "Section 6 - Procedures",
        "subsection": null,
        "topic": "Advertising a Position",
        "subtopic": null,
        "paragraph_start": 9,
        "paragraph_end": 9,
        "source_url": "https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/document/view.php?id=58",
        "status_details_url": "https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/document/status-and-details.php?id=58",
        "status": "Current",
        "effective_date": "4th July 2025",
        "review_date": "4th July 2028",
        "approval_authority": "Vice-Chancellor",
        "approval_date": "4th July 2025",
        "version": null,
        "text": "Advertising a Position\n(9)\nTo advertise the Head of Department position internally, a Job Card must be raised through Page Up via an Expression of Interest process. For more information contact Talent Acquisition."
    },
    {
        "chunk_id": "58-11",
        "document_id": "58",
        "policy_title": "Recruitment Procedure -  Head of Department",
        "heading_level": "h3",
        "section": "Section 6 - Procedures",
        "subsection": null,
        "topic": "Application",
        "subtopic": null,
        "paragraph_start": 10,
        "paragraph_end": 10,
        "source_url": "https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/document/view.php?id=58",
        "status_details_url": "https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/document/status-and-details.php?id=58",
        "status": "Current",
        "effective_date": "4th July 2025",
        "review_date": "4th July 2028",
        "approval_authority": "Vice-Chancellor",
        "approval_date": "4th July 2025",
        "version": null,
        "text": "Application\n(10)\nTo apply for the position, internal candidates are required to:\nsubmit an expression of interest including any required documents requested in the advertisement through Page Up; and\naddress any requirements that are specified as part of the application process for that position."
    },
    {
        "chunk_id": "58-12",
        "document_id": "58",
        "policy_title": "Recruitment Procedure -  Head of Department",
        "heading_level": "h3",
        "section": "Section 6 - Procedures",
        "subsection": null,
        "topic": "Selection Process",
        "subtopic": null,
        "paragraph_start": 11,
        "paragraph_end": 12,
        "source_url": "https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/document/view.php?id=58",
        "status_details_url": "https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/document/status-and-details.php?id=58",
        "status": "Current",
        "effective_date": "4th July 2025",
        "review_date": "4th July 2028",
        "approval_authority": "Vice-Chancellor",
        "approval_date": "4th July 2025",
        "version": null,
        "text": "Selection Process\n(11)\nThe Head of Department Selection Committee will make a selection based on merit.\n(12)\nFor internal applicants the Head of Department Selection Committee will comprise:\nDean (Chair) or delegate\nDeputy Provost or delegate\nHead of Department of another area or delegate; and\nSenior Member (normally Level D or E) or staff from the department"
    },
    {
        "chunk_id": "58-13",
        "document_id": "58",
        "policy_title": "Recruitment Procedure -  Head of Department",
        "heading_level": "h3",
        "section": "Section 6 - Procedures",
        "subsection": null,
        "topic": "Assessment of Suitable Candidates",
        "subtopic": null,
        "paragraph_start": 13,
        "paragraph_end": 13,
        "source_url": "https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/document/view.php?id=58",
        "status_details_url": "https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/document/status-and-details.php?id=58",
        "status": "Current",
        "effective_date": "4th July 2025",
        "review_date": "4th July 2028",
        "approval_authority": "Vice-Chancellor",
        "approval_date": "4th July 2025",
        "version": null,
        "text": "Assessment of Suitable Candidates\n(13)\nThe Head of Department Selection Committee will review submitted applications , conduct interviews, and other suitable assessments such as requesting a presentation be provided to assess for suitability against the requirements of the position based on merit."
    },
    {
        "chunk_id": "58-14",
        "document_id": "58",
        "policy_title": "Recruitment Procedure -  Head of Department",
        "heading_level": "h3",
        "section": "Section 6 - Procedures",
        "subsection": null,
        "topic": "Finalising an Appointment",
        "subtopic": null,
        "paragraph_start": 14,
        "paragraph_end": 15,
        "source_url": "https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/document/view.php?id=58",
        "status_details_url": "https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/document/status-and-details.php?id=58",
        "status": "Current",
        "effective_date": "4th July 2025",
        "review_date": "4th July 2028",
        "approval_authority": "Vice-Chancellor",
        "approval_date": "4th July 2025",
        "version": null,
        "text": "Finalising an Appointment\n(14)\nThe Chair will make a verbal offer to the successful candidate and upon verbal acceptance from the candidate, submit the outcome to the Talent Acquisition team to generate the offer card in PageUp.\n(15)\nA contract will be sent to the successful candidate for acceptance electronically."
    },
    {
        "chunk_id": "58-15",
        "document_id": "58",
        "policy_title": "Recruitment Procedure -  Head of Department",
        "heading_level": "h3",
        "section": "Section 6 - Procedures",
        "subsection": null,
        "topic": "Internal Appointments",
        "subtopic": null,
        "paragraph_start": 16,
        "paragraph_end": 16,
        "source_url": "https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/document/view.php?id=58",
        "status_details_url": "https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/document/status-and-details.php?id=58",
        "status": "Current",
        "effective_date": "4th July 2025",
        "review_date": "4th July 2028",
        "approval_authority": "Vice-Chancellor",
        "approval_date": "4th July 2025",
        "version": null,
        "text": "Internal Appointments\n(16)\nAll internal appointments to a Head of Department position will be on a Secondment arrangement."
    },
    {
        "chunk_id": "58-16",
        "document_id": "58",
        "policy_title": "Recruitment Procedure -  Head of Department",
        "heading_level": "h3",
        "section": "Section 6 - Procedures",
        "subsection": null,
        "topic": "External Appointments",
        "subtopic": null,
        "paragraph_start": 17,
        "paragraph_end": 19,
        "source_url": "https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/document/view.php?id=58",
        "status_details_url": "https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/document/status-and-details.php?id=58",
        "status": "Current",
        "effective_date": "4th July 2025",
        "review_date": "4th July 2028",
        "approval_authority": "Vice-Chancellor",
        "approval_date": "4th July 2025",
        "version": null,
        "text": "External Appointments\n(17)\nIn exceptional circumstances, and on the recommendation of the Dean, the Provost may approve the decision to externally recruit a senior academic.\n(18)\nAn external appointment will combine a substantive academic position with a fixed-term secondment to Head of Department position (up to a maximum of three (3) years).\n(19)\nTo initiate an external recruitment process, contact Talent Acquisition."
    },
    {
        "chunk_id": "58-17",
        "document_id": "58",
        "policy_title": "Recruitment Procedure -  Head of Department",
        "heading_level": "h3",
        "section": "Section 6 - Procedures",
        "subsection": null,
        "topic": "Termination of Appointment",
        "subtopic": null,
        "paragraph_start": 20,
        "paragraph_end": 22,
        "source_url": "https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/document/view.php?id=58",
        "status_details_url": "https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/document/status-and-details.php?id=58",
        "status": "Current",
        "effective_date": "4th July 2025",
        "review_date": "4th July 2028",
        "approval_authority": "Vice-Chancellor",
        "approval_date": "4th July 2025",
        "version": null,
        "text": "Termination of Appointment\n(20)\nThe Head of Department secondment will end at the date outlined in the contract of employment, unless terminated earlier.\n(21)\nThe Dean in consultation with the Chief People Officer may recommend the early termination of the Head of Department secondment to the Provost.\n(22)\nThe Provost has final authority to approve the early termination of Head of Department secondment. The incumbent will then revert to their substantive academic position."
    },
    {
