        "version": null,
        "text": "Section 7 - Definitions\n(23)\nFor the purpose of this Procedure:\nJob Card: is the process in Page Up where hiring managers provide details of a position and recruitment requirements;\nPage Up: is the University’s e-recruitment system."
    },
